Welcome! Glad to see you here at the
Rotation Battle House.{VAR BE01}
As the name suggests, this is the place
to enjoy Rotation Battles.{VAR BE01}
May I explain how Rotation Battles work?

Rotation Battle is a battle format in
which each side uses three Pokémon.{VAR BE01}
One Pokémon takes the lead position, and
the other two stand off to the sides.{VAR BE01}
But this position will change every turn!
